-    # Suffix is branch-derived: master → -torii (stable), nova → -nova
-    # (experimental, ships as GitHub prerelease). The next-N counter
-    # scans ALL three known suffixes (legacy -lazer, current -torii,
-    # experimental -nova) for the same day so version numbers never
-    # collide across streams — a -nova release after a -torii on the
-    # same day still gets a unique N.
-    steps:
