-          # Counter is SHARED across all known suffixes for the day. We
-          # scan legacy -lazer (pre-rename), current -torii (stable), and
-          # -nova (experimental) so a same-day release in any stream gets
-          # a unique N. Example: with v2026.511.0-lazer + v2026.511.1-torii
-          # existing, the next nova push computes v2026.511.2-nova.
-          MAXN=-1
